        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "You are an invoice data extraction assistant.",
              "role": "model"
            },
            {
              "content": "=Extract the following information from the invoice text:\n\n- invoice_number\n- invoice_date\n- vendor_name\n- customer_name\n- customer_address\n- salesperson\n- po_number\n- payment_terms\n- items\n- grand_total\n\nFor the \"items\" field, return an array of objects.\n\nEvery item MUST use exactly these field names:\n- item_name\n- quantity\n- unit_price\n- total_price\n\nDo not use \"description\" or any other field name.\n\nIf a value is not present in the invoice, return null.\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON. Do not use Markdown or code fences.\n\nUse exactly this JSON structure:\n\n{\n  \"invoice_number\": \"\",\n  \"invoice_date\": \"\",\n  \"vendor_name\": \"\",\n  \"customer_name\": \"\",\n  \"customer_address\": \"\",\n  \"salesperson\": null,\n  \"po_number\": null,\n  \"payment_terms\": \"\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"item_name\": \"\",\n      \"quantity\": 0,\n      \"unit_price\": 0,\n      \"total_price\": 0\n    }\n  ],\n  \"grand_total\": 0\n}\n\nInvoice text:\n{{ $json.text }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "jsonOutput": true,
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.googleGemini",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        416,
        0
      ],
      "id": "a00fd254-3aaa-4c8d-bf18-203e97bbd4b3",
      "name": "Message a model",
      "credentials": {
        "googlePalmApi": {
          "id": "NhxdqAVxajSI96wq",
          "name": "Google Gemini(PaLM) Api account 2"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "let output = $input.first().json.content.parts[0].text;\n\noutput = output\n  .replace(/```json/g, '')\n  .replace(/```/g, '')\n  .trim();\n\nconst data = JSON.parse(output);\n\nconst items = data.items || [];\n\nreturn [\n  ...items.map((item, index) => ({\n    json: {\n      invoice_number: index === 0 ? data.invoice_number : \"\",\n      invoice_date: index === 0 ? data.invoice_date : \"\",\n      vendor_name: index === 0 ? data.vendor_name : \"\",\n      customer_name: index === 0 ? data.customer_name : \"\",\n      customer_address: index === 0 ? data.customer_address : \"\",\n      salesperson: index === 0 ? data.salesperson : \"\",\n      po_number: index === 0 ? data.po_number : \"\",\n      payment_terms: index === 0 ? data.payment_terms : \"\",\n\n      item_description: item.item_name,\n      quantity: item.quantity,\n      unit_price: item.unit_price,\n      item_total: item.total_price\n    }\n  })),\n\n  {\n    json: {\n      invoice_number: \"\",\n      invoice_date: \"\",\n      vendor_name: \"\",\n      customer_name: \"\",\n      customer_address: \"\",\n      salesperson: \"\",\n      po_number: \"\",\n      payment_terms: \"\",\n\n      item_description: \"GRAND TOTAL\",\n      quantity: \"\",\n      unit_price: \"\",\n      item_total: data.grand_total\n    }\n  }\n];"
      },
